## Summary of Changes

### 1. Replaced MediatR with Waseet.CQRS-Compatible Implementation

Since the Waseet.CQRS NuGet package only supports .NET 10 and the current SDK is .NET 9, I created a local implementation that mirrors the Waseet.CQRS API exactly. This enables:
- The code to use Waseet.CQRS interfaces now
- Easy migration to the actual NuGet package when upgrading to .NET 10 (just delete the local files and add the package reference)

