### Communication Patterns

| Pattern | When to Use | Example |
|---------|-------------|---------|
| **Domain Events** | State changes that other modules care about | `ShipmentCreatedEvent` â Stocks reserves inventory |
| **Query Interface** | Read-only data from another module | Shipments queries Carrier rates |
| **Shared Kernel** | Truly shared concepts | `Address` value object, `Money` type |

