## Key Differences from Your Current Template

| Aspect | Your Template | Evently |
|--------|--------------|---------|
| **Module Layers** | 3 (Domain, Infrastructure, Features) | 5 (Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Presentation, PublicApi) |
| **CQRS** | Custom IHandler | MediatR with ICommand/IQuery |
| **Endpoints** | Combined in Features | Separate Presentation layer |
| **Cross-module** | Direct references possible | PublicApi contracts only |
| **Queries** | Through repositories | Dapper for reads (CQRS) |
| **Target** | .NET 9 | .NET 8 |

